{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"citified-earth-cottontail","creation_channel":"mcp","description":"## Context / Problem\nCites are on origin/main 083620b0.\n\n`src/rebar/_store/hlc.py:57-67` reads `REBAR_HLC_NOW` (setters: `tests/unit/test_hlc.py:33-77`, `tests/interfaces/facades/test_cli_js_safe_integers.py:91`, `tests/interfaces/io/test_export_ndjson_js_safe.py:96` — all in-process; `tests/integration/test_concurrency_regression.py:599,1693-1811` — subprocess). It controls the physical component of the HLC tick (`hlc.py:125,130`) and compaction horizons (`compact.py:253`, `compact_trigger.py:113`, `compact_txn.py:469`). `src/rebar/_commands/compact_txn.py:179-195` reads `REBAR_TEST_COMPACT_RENAME_BARRIER` (setter: `tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_compact_process_death.py:101`, subprocess + SIGKILL); it pauses after the first `*.retired` rename (`:285`). Both carry `# read-via:` markers budgeted in `tests/scripts/test_store_snapshot_io_seam_clean_heldout.py:49-53` and `tests/scripts/test_cli_seam_clean_heldout.py:61-65`, and appear in `docs/env-vars.md:57,160` and `.github/mechanism-baseline.json:505,608` (`env_var::REBAR_HLC_NOW`, `env_var::REBAR_TEST_COMPACT_RENAME_BARRIER`).\n\n## Approach\nMirror the store's injectable-callable idiom: `src/rebar/_commands/completion_verifier_run.py:76` (`clock: Callable[[], int] = monotonic_ns`), `src/rebar/_store/push_classify.py:88,100` (`sleep_fn`), `src/rebar/_store/reclaim_eligibility.py:19,45,57` (`now=`).\n- `hlc.py`: `_clock: Callable[[], int] = time.time_ns`; `physical_now()` returns `_clock()`; delete `:61-66` and the docstring sentence `:36-37`.\n- `compact_txn.py`: `def _no_rename_barrier(n_renamed: int) -> None: return None`; `_rename_barrier: Callable[[int], None] = _no_rename_barrier`; `:285` becomes `_rename_barrier(len(renamed))`; delete `:179-195` and `import time` (`:29`, its only user).\n- In-process tests monkeypatch `hlc._clock` (`test_hlc.py`, the two js_safe fixtures).\n- Subprocess tests: new `tests/_child_hooks.py::child_env(env, *, hlc_now=None, rename_barrier=None)` prepends `tests/_child_hooks_shim/` to `PYTHONPATH` and sets `REBAR_TEST_HLC_NOW` / `REBAR_TEST_COMPACT_RENAME_BARRIER`; new `tests/_child_hooks_shim/sitecustomize.py` (runs at child interpreter start; `python -m rebar.cli` and the `rebar` console script both process it) rebinds `rebar._store.hlc._clock` and `rebar._commands.compact_txn._rename_barrier` (the reached/release file protocol moves here verbatim). The env reads now live in test code only; `gen_env_registry` scans `src/rebar` (`scripts/gen_env_registry.py:449`) so both rows leave `docs/env-vars.md`. Rewire `test_concurrency_regression.py:596-602,1637-1646` through `child_env` and rename the ten `REBAR_HLC_NOW` keys to `REBAR_TEST_HLC_NOW`; `test_compact_process_death.py:100-102` uses `child_env(subprocess_env(), rename_barrier=barrier)`.\n- `tests/_child_hooks.py` is a new `tests/_*.py` module, which `scripts/_mechanism_delta/detect_ci.py::detect_test_helpers` censuses as `test_helper::tests/_child_hooks.py` (filename-glob shape: the marker lives in the file's first lines). Open the file with `# mechanism-ok: test_helper tests/_child_hooks.py — replaces the production env reads REBAR_HLC_NOW / REBAR_TEST_COMPACT_RENAME_BARRIER (this ticket)` so `python scripts/check_mechanism_delta.py --check` reports `new=0`. `tests/_child_hooks_shim/sitecustomize.py` sits in a subdirectory and is not censused.\n- `test_hlc.py:32-34` monkeypatches `_clock`; `:89-94` asserts `re.search(r\"os\\.environ\", source) is None`.\n- Budgets: `tests/scripts/test_store_snapshot_io_seam_clean_heldout.py:49-53` drop the hlc row, `_TOTAL_MARKER_CAP = 3`; `tests/scripts/test_cli_seam_clean_heldout.py:61-65` drop the compact_txn row, `_TOTAL_MARKER_CAP = 1`.\n- Regenerate `docs/env-vars.md`; run `python scripts/check_mechanism_delta.py --update-stale` (drops the two stale `env_var` rows; precedent commit `81da792`) and commit `.github/mechanism-baseline.json` in the same change (operator sanction recorded on the epic).\n\n## Scope\n`src/rebar/_store/hlc.py`, `src/rebar/_commands/compact_txn.py`, new `tests/_child_hooks.py` and `tests/_child_hooks_shim/sitecustomize.py`, `tests/unit/test_hlc.py`, `tests/interfaces/facades/test_cli_js_safe_integers.py`, `tests/interfaces/io/test_export_ndjson_js_safe.py`, `tests/integration/test_concurrency_regression.py`, `tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_compact_process_death.py`, `tests/scripts/test_store_snapshot_io_seam_clean_heldout.py`, `tests/scripts/test_cli_seam_clean_heldout.py`, `docs/env-vars.md`, `.github/mechanism-baseline.json`. Out of scope: `REBAR_RECONCILER_FAIL_SILENT_NOOP` (reconciler epic), every other env read in `src/rebar`, and the HLC tick/compaction-horizon logic itself (`hlc.py:125,130`, `compact.py:253`, `compact_trigger.py:113`, `compact_txn.py:469` keep calling `physical_now()` unchanged).\n\n## Testing\n- `pytest tests/unit/test_hlc.py tests/interfaces/facades/test_cli_js_safe_integers.py tests/interfaces/io/test_export_ndjson_js_safe.py -q`.\n- `pytest tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_compact_process_death.py -q` (child reaches the barrier via the shim; SIGKILL recovery unchanged).\n- `pytest tests/integration/test_concurrency_regression.py -k hlc -q`, `pytest tests/integration/test_concurrency_regression.py -k skew -q`, `pytest tests/integration/test_concurrency_regression.py -k scenario -q`.\n- Edge: `REBAR_HLC_NOW=1 rebar create task t` in a scratch repo → the ticket timestamp is wall-clock (the variable is ignored); `python scripts/gen_env_registry.py --check`; `python scripts/check_mechanism_delta.py --check` reports `new=0`; `python scripts/check_orphaned_load.py` clean after the SIGKILL test.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] AC1 `git grep -n 'REBAR_HLC_NOW\\|REBAR_TEST_COMPACT_RENAME_BARRIER' -- src` empty; `docs/env-vars.md` has neither row (verified by the grep and `python scripts/gen_env_registry.py --check`).\n- [ ] AC2 The seam tests `tests/scripts/test_store_snapshot_io_seam_clean_heldout.py` and `tests/scripts/test_cli_seam_clean_heldout.py` are green with `read-via` marker counts as budgeted (verified by `pytest`).\n- [ ] AC3 `tests/unit/test_mechanism_delta.py::test_the_committed_baseline_matches_the_live_tree` green and `python scripts/check_mechanism_delta.py --check` reports `new=0`; `make verify` green.","id":"b939-bc68-1cb2-4ee9","parent_id":"e12f-a994-29d3-4f72","priority":2,"tags":["complexity-reduction","breaking-pass-4"],"ticket_type":"story","title":"Move test hooks out of production: replace the `REBAR_HLC_NOW` and `REBAR_TEST_COMPACT_RENAME_BARRIER` env reads with injectable callables"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1788807566086132944,"uuid":"b4e5df13-7bad-477c-8bcf-b526bd992616"}